<%# What PasswordPolicy asks of a password, shown under every field that sets one. %>
<div class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">
  At least <%= PasswordPolicy::MIN_LENGTH %> characters, with an uppercase letter, a
  lowercase letter, a number and a special character. No common words or
  patterns, nothing from your username or email address, and not one you've
  used before. A long phrase of unrelated words with a few symbols is easier to
  remember than it sounds.
</div>
